#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Mart/scripts.inc:39
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Mart_Text_ReviveIsFantastic"
msgid ""
"REVIVE is fantastic!\p"
"Give it to a fainted POKéMON,\n"
"and the POKéMON will arise.\p"
"But be careful, REVIVE doesn't restore\n"
"the used-up PP of moves.$"
msgstr ""
"活力碎片太棒了！\p"
"给濒死的宝可梦使用，\n"
"宝可梦就会重新站起来。\p"
"不过要注意，活力碎片\n"
"不能恢复招式用掉的PP。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Mart/scripts.inc:46
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Mart_Text_MaxRepelLastsLongest"
msgid ""
"MAX REPEL keeps all weak POKéMON away.\p"
"Out of all the REPEL sprays, it lasts\n"
"the longest.$"
msgstr ""
"黄金喷雾能让弱小的宝可梦\n"
"全都不靠近。\p"
"在所有的除虫喷雾里，\n"
"它的效果持续得最久。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Mart/scripts.inc:51
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Mart_Text_NetAndDiveBallsRare"
msgid ""
"The NET and DIVE BALLS are rare POKé\n"
"BALLS that are only made in MOSSDEEP.\p"
"A NET BALL is effective against\n"
"BUG-type and WATER-type POKéMON.\p"
"A DIVE BALL works best on POKéMON\n"
"at the bottom of the sea.$"
msgstr ""
"捕网球和潜水球是只在绿岭市\n"
"制造的稀有精灵球。\p"
"捕网球对虫属性和\n"
"水属性的宝可梦很有效。\p"
"潜水球对海底的宝可梦\n"
"效果最好。$"
